                    {
                        "sense_id": "937577ee-849a-3c17-b850-da4f2fceb184",
                        "entry_id": "74bbaf91-e095-3816-97e1-370a38498a9f",
                        "glosses": [
                            "teahouse, teashop (a cafe that sells tea)"
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "Central-Asia",
                            "Iran"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "50526c04-417a-4744-a5c0-e4f04195f7e1",
                                "sense_id": "937577ee-849a-3c17-b850-da4f2fceb184",
                                "text": "Улегла́сь моя́ была́я ра́на —\nПья́ный бред не гло́жет се́рдце мне.\nСи́ними цвета́ми Тегера́на\nЯ лечу́ их ны́нче в чайхане́.",
                                "translation": "On my heart's blооd drink is no more feeding,\nThose old fears of mine I now can calm.\nТо а teahouse I have соmе to heal them\nWith the dark-blue flowers of Teheran.",
                                "english": "On my heart's blооd drink is no more feeding,\nThose old fears of mine I now can calm.\nТо а teahouse I have соmе to heal them\nWith the dark-blue flowers of Teheran."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
